spice
* Node Definitions
* Node 1: Source of M1, M2
* Node 2: Drain of M1 and M2, Source of I_Q
* Node 3: Source and gate of M3, M4
* Node 4: V+
* Node 5: V-
* Node 6: Gate of M1
* Node 7: Source of M4, Drain of M1
* Node 8: Output Vo
* Node 9: Drain of M3

* Transistors
M1 2 6 1 1 NMOS
M2 2 3 1 1 NMOS
M3 4 3 9 9 PMOS
M4 7 3 8 8 PMOS

* Resistors
RD1 4 9 RD1
RD2 3 5 RD2
RS 7 5 RS

* Current Source
IQ 2 6 DC

* Voltage Sources
V1 6 5 DC v1
V2 3 5 DC v2
VPLUS 4 0 DC 3
VMINUS 5 0 DC -3

* End of Netlist